# Ruling 2015-06-22: if the ability doesn't resolve (its target becomes illegal), the mode chosen for that instance still counts as chosen.
# Turn 3 upkeep: Bot1 chooses the damage mode and targets Bot2's Llanowar Elves; in response Bot2 Lightning Bolts its own Elves. The
# ability's only target is illegal, so it does not resolve (CR 608.2b): Bot1 does NOT gain 4 life (still 20). Turn 5: the damage mode is refused
# (`! Bot1.Modes(1)`) though it never happened - the positive control is the draw mode taken on the next line - and ChosenModes shows 1 and 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Demonic Pact
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island x14

